			<name>B05</name>
			<snippet></snippet>
			<description><![CDATA[<div>Sensor in front of Helipad 9 sign. Seismic (nanometrics) #2392. Infrasound #414. Digitizer #386. Seis notes: horizontal components are ok. Vertical component pinned. Infrasound checked out ok.&nbsp;<br></div>]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>-80.63449548970306</longitude>
				<latitude>28.63203822789207</latitude>
				<altitude>1.015284381899124</altitude>
				<heading>0.00133643149957686</heading>
				<tilt>0</tilt>
				<gx:fovy>35</gx:fovy>
				<range>78.3784419589665</range>
