			<description><![CDATA[<div>Seismic (nanometrics) #2619. Infrasound #0224. Digitizer #166. Lead acid battery. 35 amp hr. Solar panel 30w. Waveforms good. Infrasound signal noisy, unconfirmed.&nbsp;<br></div>]]></description>
